  "title": "Method for producing 3-bromomethylbenzoic acids",
  "abstract": "A process is described for preparing 3-bromomethylbenzoic acids of the formula II by brominating the corresponding 3-methylbenzoic acids. In addition, compounds of the formula II are described where R1 is fluorine chlorine or bromine, and R2 is (C1-C4)alkyl.",
